---
description: OCTOPUS platform clinical trial simulation project conventions and safeguards
globs:
  - "**/*.R"
  - "**/*.Rmd"
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AI_CONTEXT.md` before changing this project and treat it as authoritative.

- Preserve OCTOPUS class-driven S3 method names, signatures, and return structures.
- Inspect `BuildMe.R` and the relevant trial and simulation setup files before editing.
- Surface ambiguous clinical or statistical assumptions instead of inventing values.
- Never edit generated outputs under `enrollment/`, `out/`, `ISAOut*/`, or `log/`.
- Parse changed R files and use a deterministic one-replication smoke run before full simulations.